 "b4_text_layer_sanitized": "40\nA bullet from a gun is fired on a rectangular wooden block with velocity u. When bullet travels 24 cm\nthrough the block along its length horizontally, velocity of bullet becomes u/3. Then it further\npenetrates into the block in the same direction before coming to rest exactly at the other end of the\nblock. The total length of the block is :\n(1)\n27 cm\n(2)\n24 cm\n(3)\n28 cm\n(4)\n30 cm\n\n2\nu +\n2\n2as\n​\n=\n(3\nu)\n2\nu +\n2\n2a ⋅\n24 ⇒\n​ =\n9\nu2\nu +\n2\n48a ⇒48a = −\n​ ⇒\n9\n8u2\na = −\n​\n54\nu2\n0 =\n​\n+\n(3\nu)\n2\n2 −\n​\nx ⇒\n(\n54\nu2 )\n0 =\n​ −\n9\nu2\n​x ⇒\n27\nu2\nx = 27 cm −24 cm = 3 cm\n24 cm +\n3 cm = 27 cm\n",
 "b4_script_options": {
  "1": "27 cm",
  "2": "24 cm",
  "3": "28 cm",
  "4": "30 cm\n\n2\nu +\n2\n2as\n​\n=\n(3\nu)\n2\nu +\n2\n2a ⋅\n24 ⇒\n​ =\n9\nu2\nu +\n2\n48a ⇒48a = −\n​ ⇒\n9\n8u2\na = −\n​\n54\nu2\n0 =\n​\n+\n(3\nu)\n2\n2 −\n​\nx ⇒\n(\n54\nu2 )\n0 =\n​ −\n9\nu2\n​x ⇒\n27\nu2\nx = 27 cm −24 cm = 3 cm\n24 cm +\n3 cm = 27 cm"
 },
